+
+# Request
+
+A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price. Quotes and bookings both show the reduced total.
+
+# Acceptance
+
+- Rentals of 1 or 2 days keep the full price (days x dailyPrice).
+- Rentals of 3 days or more total the full price less 10%, rounded to the nearest euro cent (integer cents).
+- `quote` and `book` return the same reduced total.
